abstract: "Code, raw data and papers of the COMPASS project: an active-learning engine that maps where in condition space levels of life-like behaviour appear in stochastic origin-of-life models (Paper 1), its application to a bottom-up chemistry over environmental variables (Paper 2), and the Gokyona Environment platform. Code is MIT; documents and figures are CC BY 4.0."
